problem: macOS CI restored cached ~/.cargo/bin entries causing cargo to invoke rustup-init
approach: Removed ~/.cargo/bin from actions/cache paths and disabled binary caching for release rust-cache jobs
failed_paths:
  - FUSE implementation itself passed local checks; failure was CI environment cache poisoning
verification:
  - gh run view logs showed rustup-init handling cargo build
  - grep confirmed no ~/.cargo/bin workflow cache entries remain
workflow_learning: Do not cache Rust toolchain shim directories; cache registries/git db/target only
related_files:
  - .github/workflows/rust-ci.yml
  - .github/workflows/pr-check.yml
  - .github/workflows/release-beta-on-push.yml
  - .github/workflows/release.yml
